+  - This package includes binary libraries of the FFmpeg project,
+    licensed under the GNU General Public License v2 or later
+    (BtbN "gpl" shared build). Full license text: LICENSE-FFMPEG.txt
+    in this package. FFmpeg source: https://ffmpeg.org
+  - NVIDIA, CUDA and RTX are trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation.
+
+DISCLAIMER / DESCARGO DE RESPONSABILIDAD
+  This software is provided "as is" (AS IS), without warranty of
+  any kind, express or implied. The author is not liable for
