+MODELS (published by Neroued / publicados por Neroued)
+  https://huggingface.co/neroued/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NInfer   (primary, ~19 GB)
+  https://huggingface.co/neroued/Qwen3.8-27B-NInfer       (also verified here)
